A pure-JavaScript reader/builder for `.carbonwebgpu` effect containers, plus
effect analysis and a DXBC to WGSL translator.

The container is CarbonEngine's version-15 compiled-effect container, read and
written through the shared codec in `src/resource/format/carbonEffect`. That
codec ports CarbonEngine's `Tr2EffectRes.cpp` and the shader compiler's file
assembly, released by Fenris Creations (CCP Games) under the MIT License
(<https://github.com/carbonengine>); see `format-notices/hlsl`. The program
slots carry WGSL in place of DXBC, with an optional per-pass backend block.

The DXBC-to-IR lowering, WGSL emitter, effect analysis and binding plan are
original CarbonEngineJS work. They read DXBC only through the sibling
`formats/dxbc` reader, whose token format Microsoft publishes; see
`format-notices/dxbc`. No third-party translator source is included.

